cJSON_ParseWithLength parses the first value and ignores anything after it,
so input such as `5 6` or `{"a":1} trailing` was accepted.  Require the
whole string to be one JSON value plus optional whitespace.  cJSON checks
for a NUL terminator inside the buffer, so pass the length including the
terminator Tcl_GetStringFromObj guarantees.  On failure, report the line,
column (in characters) and an excerpt from where parsing stopped.
tests/parse_errors.test covers both.

